      "writtenOn": "2026-10-01T17:27:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You are right this example does not work: a deny on a subgroup cannot carve it out of a broad allow.\n\nBut a deny on the same group does suppress the allow, so deny is not generally ignored. Block does not fix it either (same-section ALLOW overrides BLOCK).\n\nThe working options are grant only to the intended groups, or block the subgroup in a child project.\n\nDoc updated accordingly.",
      "parentUuid": "b8375964_c7818a40",
      "revId": "ea4a86bd25d08d5c5a1d0654087dcc613d15ab6b",
